OL,4,CRising food costs in India           W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GIndia's inflation is rising again.   W5
OL,7,GAnd the biggest worry is what's      W5
OL,8,Ghappening to food prices.            W5
OL,9,                                      W5
OL,10,GThe latest government data shows     W5
OL,11,Gretail inflation climbed to 6.09% in W5
OL,12,GOctober, up from 5.54% in September. W5
OL,13,                                      W5
OL,14,GBut look more closely at food        W5
OL,15,Ginflation. It has surged to 8.94%.   W5
OL,16,                                      W5
OL,17,GThe squeeze was sharper in rural     W5
OL,18,GIndia, where food inflation was      W5
OL,19,G9.09%, compared with 8.68% in urban  W5
OL,20,Gareas.                               W5
